The refactor tool is not available to make the method virtual for testing. I will write a test that directly tests the StartServer method by invoking it with mocks and verifying the behavior of the IServiceProvider.GetRequiredService call and the RunShutdownTask call on the IJellyfinDatabaseProvider mock.

I will create a test class with a test method that sets up the necessary mocks and calls StartServer with test parameters. Since StartServer is private static, I will use reflection to invoke it.

I will submit the test file now. It will use Moq for mocking and xUnit for the test framework. The test will verify that the GetRequiredService call is made and RunShutdownTask is called with a cancellation token.

